7c94ecb4822977717558195c42ae4fd", "message": "Rename balanced.subsequence to Balanced_Subsequence.java", "created_at": "2017-01-05T08:05:28Z", "repo": "coderack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ae5d7369bca78781a352154dcf1d17bc0877f220", "message": "balanced.subsequence\n\nPrint the length of longest balanced sub sequence of brackets.", "created_at": "2016-11-10T07:38:41Z", "repo": "coderack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dd0dec97f19a2c1673400cbabd84a9f63b366eb4", "message": "new.year.chaos\n\nThere are  people queued up, and each person wears a sticker indicating their initial position in the queue (i.e.:1,2,3....n-1,n)  with the first number denoting the frontmost position).Any person in the queue can bribe the person directly in front of them to swap positions. If two people swap positions, they still wear the same sticker denoting their original place in line. One person can bribe at most two other persons. Print the minimum number of bribes that took place to get the queue into its current state, as the result.", "created_at": "2016-11-10T07:14:40Z", "repo": "coderack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6bd403e5875766d0e4c68216d76a29a909efddc7", "message": "spiral.message\n\nA message originated as a single line of one or more space-separated words, but it was encoded into an nxm  matrix as a clockwise spiral starting in the lower left-hand corner. The message is decoded spirally starting from the lower left-hand corner of the matrix and moving in the clockwise direction (i.e., up, right, down, left, up, right, etc.). From the starting position, the matrix is traversed in the clockwise direction, scanning characters and switching to the next clockwise direction each time a boundary is reached (i.e., an already-scanned character or the end of the matrix). Scanning characters is continued till all the matrix's characters are scanned into a single decoded string. The word separator for the decoded string is the hash mark (#). The total number of words in the decoded string is printed as the result.", "created_at": "2016-11-10T06:45:47Z", "repo": "coderack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "15a7c48dbff29447a22280a1664ad96ea9c0de4c", "message": "Delete spiral.message", "created_at": "2016-11-10T06:44:10Z", "repo": "coderack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "da49a7c9988036b4f849c9db3de8875fa037b00b", "message": "Rename spiral message to spiral.message", "created_at": "2016-11-10T06:34:53Z", "repo": "coderack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2e4180089233a93e51c9fac1f1ed1840a733ab83", "message": "Spiral Message\n\nA message originated as a single line of one or more space-separated words, but it was encoded into an nxm  matrix as a clockwise spiral starting in the lower left-hand corner.The message is decoded spirally starting from the lower left-hand corner of the matrix and moving in the clockwise direction (i.e., up, right, down, left, up, right, etc.). From the starting position, the matrix is traversed clockwise, scanning characters and switching to the next clockwise direction each time a boundary is reached (i.e., an already-scanned character or the end of the matrix). Scanning is continued till all the matrix's characters are scanned into a single decoded string. The word separator for the decoded string is the hash mark (#). The number of words in the decoded message is printed as the result.", "created_at": "2016-11-10T06:33:40Z", "repo": "coderack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d3c0593417a07cbc622efece38356e6cbd9e22d7", "message": "answer.pseudo\n\nGenerates random numbers between 6 and 15.", "created_at": "2016-10-27T10:36:35Z", "repo": "coderack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5e9412f8d6702b08e2579aab1a7c66ec8d56d6bb", "message": "answer.pseudo\n\nGenerates random numbers between 6 and 15.", "created_at": "2016-10-27T10:01:56Z", "repo": "coderack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0cf5c7a6846fb65f01ccdd50810cbc148b95357a", "message": "Delete README.md", "created_at": "2016-10-27T09:49:06Z", "repo": "coderack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "761407cf44c59d415bcda7808da1250e73cb3232", "message": "first commit", "created_at": "2016-10-27T09:42:29Z", "repo": "coderack", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1716911e5f99339e573dee191fe6c8c93c1b7d6b", "message": "test tektob triggers", "created_at": "2020-04-02T10:01:57Z", "repo": "Che-NativeClient", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7aa9218fbd69f1b0ed0d8d154e8036ff7f3c4dd4", "message": "Added Start Workspace Button\n\nAdded a button to start stopped workspaces", "created_at": "2018-09-27T10:46:36Z", "repo": "Che-NativeClient", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "eaf61e05ef1210d14d63c318716b05d8a236e9b1", "message": "Added Start Workspace Button\n\nAdded a button to start stopped workspaces", "created_at": "2018-09-27T10:38:29Z", "repo": "Che-NativeClient", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "99e53e31502b66d8cffd948aa998279df0da21a8", "message": "Working template React Frontend with API", "created_at": "2018-09-21T14:15:30Z", "repo": "Che-NativeClient", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8cd7aa601cc568225d19ff1bb7850b659c07a635", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2018-09-21T13:56:30Z", "repo": "Che-NativeClient", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}